---
// PRD §1, §2: Tether Landing Page (Light Ribbon theme, AC-P14-07)
import '../styles/theme.css';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
  <title>Tether — Private AI Browser Connector</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }
    header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.35em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    p.tagline {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--t-text-500);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
    .card h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--t-teal-fg);
      margin-top: 0;
    }
    .card p {
      color: var(--t-text-700);
    }
    .links {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .links a {
      color: var(--t-blue-fg);
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .links a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1 class="hero-title">TETHER</h1>
      <p class="tagline">The local-first browser connector for autonomous AI agents. Zero plaintext on wire. Single point of policy.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="t-card card">
        <h2>Mode A: Local-Only</h2>
        <p>Direct loopback WebSocket connection between your CLI/IDE and Chrome extension. 100% offline, zero network egress, fully air-gapped.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="t-card card">
        <h2>Mode B: Hosted Relay</h2>
        <p>End-to-end encrypted relay for web/mobile LLMs (Claude, ChatGPT). Zero plaintext stored at rest. 256-bit X25519 ECDH envelope.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="t-card card">
        <h2>Mode C: WebMCP Proxy</h2>
        <p>Automatic discovery of site-declared <code>document.modelContext</code> tools, strictly namespaced per-origin to eliminate spoofing risks.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="/pair">Device Pairing</a>
      <a href="/retention">Data Retention</a>
      <a href="/threat-model">Threat Model</a>
      <a href="/protocol">Protocol Reference</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
